name = "Phantom Killer"
description = "An enemy who loses to her Mindfulness believes something is killing them: a psychic wound each turn. As each turn starts they weigh it again, doubting it a little more every time, and once their Mindfulness beats hers they stop believing. It lasts no longer than she holds the tether."
